    "notes": "NSIS installer with two-layer packaging: an NSIS wrapper containing app-64.7z (~436 MB) with the full portable app. pre_install extracts the NSIS package via Expand-7zipArchive and pulls out app-64.7z; post_install extracts it into $dir. User data lives in %USERPROFILE%\\.pilotdeck (outside the app directory), so no persist is needed. Requires the 7-Zip helper (scoop install 7zip)."
